    "title": "Spotlight",
    "summary": "Placard with the colour taken out of the row.",
    "description": "Placard with the colour taken out of the row. At rest every face is desaturated, so nine portraits read as one group instead of nine things competing; the face under the pointer is the only one in colour, lifts out of the row, and a plate springs in above it with the name beside a single green mark. Colour and lift both carry the state, because a face that only grew would still be lost among eight coloured neighbours. The saturation ramp is a plain CSS transition rather than part of the spring, since a spring that overshoots would flash past full colour on the way in. The plate is a single element moved between anchors, so at most one is ever mounted and an exit can never be cut short by a second plate arriving, and the row clears the active face on its own leave rather than each face clearing itself. Focus drives it as well as hover, and reduced motion keeps the colour without the travel.",
